   "desc": "Part (b): the entry in row 1, column 2 of the product is 59, and a correct response reads it as the total staff minutes needed on Saturday across both bike types -- 8 standard rentals at 4 minutes each plus 3 electric rentals at 9 minutes each. Full credit names the row (Saturday), the column (staff minutes) and the fact that the entry is a total over the two bike types. Saying only 'it is 59 minutes' without identifying the row and column does not show that the student can read a product matrix.",
